      {
        "step_number": 1,
        "title": "Press and prep",
        "body": "Press the tofu for 15 minutes. That press is the prep window: shred the cabbage, grate the carrot, chop the cilantro, and juice the limes while it presses. Cut the tofu into 3/4-inch cubes and pat dry.",
        "ingredient_refs": [
