        "step_number": 2,
        "title": "Season the tofu",
        "body": "Toss the cubes with 1 tbsp neutral oil, the cornstarch, chipotle powder, smoked paprika, cumin, garlic powder, 1/2 tsp kosher salt, and 1/4 tsp black pepper until coated.",
